gstack — Garry Tan
========================================

Loom's judgment layer, ship-engineer cluster, retrospective ceremony,
browser daemon foundation, and direct-symlink distribution path were
adapted from Garry Tan's gstack (https://github.com/garrytan/gstack),
published under the MIT License. Copyright Garry Tan. Per locked
decision C-01 ("Adopt, don't fork") of the gstack-adoption roadmap,
every idea was re-authored as a Loom-native resource (agent / prompt /
protocol / skill / infrastructure); no gstack code was copied verbatim.

The following thirteen shipped milestones and thirty-six features are
attributed to gstack as the source of the underlying idea (milestone
